{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/663608-clan-blood-fluff","id":663608,"title":"Clan Blood Fluff","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-13T17:39:57-07:00","id":663608,"title":"Clan Blood Fluff","content":"I feel like this is a thing I knew but I'm drawing a blank, so I'm shamelessly gonna come ask for help.<br /> <br /> Where in the books - I'm mostly thinking 1E but if there's something in 2 I forgot, by all means bring it up - are the taste/feeling/motifs of the different clans' vitae described? Somewhere it talks about their influence on mandragora, I'm pretty sure, and I think there was also something about taste, sensations, something like that.<br /> <br /> FWIW, I'm working on adapting this for a PC with Bloodhound, and looking for inspirational material.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1134-nicias","name":"Nicias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"274"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-13T17:58:34-07:00","id":663634,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure if it's what you recall seeing, but the first chapter of The Danse Macabre has a section on each of the clans that has sensory descriptions of how frenzy, the Embrace and the Kiss are colored by each clan's feel and nature.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/ava